      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "013.php 修改密码处 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者通过 HTTP 请求提交参数 password_conf（013.php:9 读取），该值被赋给 $pass_new 后直接字符串拼接进 UPDATE 语句：013.php:30 构造 $insert = \"UPDATE `users` SET password = '$pass_new' WHERE user = '\" . dvwaCurrentUser() . \"' LIMIT 1;\"，其中 $pass_new 未做任何转义或参数化；随后 013.php:31 通过 mysqli_query($GLOBALS[\"___mysqli_ston\"], $insert) 执行。由于单引号可被注入，攻击者可闭合 password 字段的字符串字面量，改写 SET 子句或追加条件，从而改变 UPDATE 语义。代码中未见 mysqli_real_escape_string、预处理语句或白名单校验，校验完全缺失。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "013.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 29,
                  "endLine": 31
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "GEN-89dab2f7ae60"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "GEN-89dab2f7ae60",
            "confidence": 0.53,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-89",
            "endpoint": "/013",
            "http_method": "ANY",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/auth_bypass",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "DVWA 密码修改接口 CAPTCHA 校验可被伪造请求头绕过（硬编码后门值）\n\n013.php 在处理密码修改时，CAPTCHA 校验逻辑为 `if ($resp || ($_POST['g-recaptcha-response'] == 'hidd3n_valu3' && $_SERVER['HTTP_USER_AGENT'] == 'reCAPTCHA'))`。攻击者无需真正通过 reCAPTCHA，只需提交固定字符串 `hidd3n_valu3` 作为 g-recaptcha-response，并把 User-Agent 设为 `reCAPTCHA`，即可让整个条件恒真，进入密码修改分支。该分支随后用 md5 处理新密码并执行 UPDATE 语句修改当前用户密码，导致攻击者在不知道原密码、不通过人机校验的情况下重置账户密码，构成认证绕过/账户接管。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "013.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 17,
                  "endLine": 31
                }
              }
            }
          ],
